{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112810","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112810/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112810/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112810/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112810","id":3628632442,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6znWCC","number":112810,"title":"`FTI` - `Camera2D` accepts resets only after entering tree","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-11-15T12:16:02Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T19:58:08Z","closed_at":"2025-11-25T15:56:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112810","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112810","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112810.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112810.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-25T15:56:48Z"},"body":"Fixes #112689\r\n\r\n#111384 introduced a warning when calling `Camera2D::get_camera_transform()` before the camera viewports had been set up in `NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE`.\r\n\r\nThis flagged a benign warning when using physics interpolation on `Camera2D`, because it inherits a standard reset from `CanvasItem` which is called before `Camera2D` `NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE`.\r\n\r\nHere we use a simple approach to fix the warning, by adding a state flag of whether to accept resets, and set to true after setup, and set to false when exiting the tree.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n* There's a number of ways of fixing this - we could alternatively just not spam the warning introduced in #111384. Although it's fairly easy to workaround here, and it is possible the warning might catch bugs.\r\n* The post-warning and the previous version both work fine, as there is a secondary manual reset performed in `Camera2D` at the end of `NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE` (and a comment to that effect), so this warning is purely cosmetic.\r\n* Not necessary in 3.x as we don't have the warning.\r\n\r\n## Discussion\r\nAs noted in the issue, this is caused by the `CanvasItem` `NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE` being called _before_ the `Camera2D`, so the resets can't depend on any state set up in derived classes, which isn't ideal, but thus far this hasn't been a significant problem - most classes xforms are up to date by this point.\r\n\r\nAn alternative we sometimes use is to _defer_ resets, but this has the potential to cause knock on bugs particularly with moving and standing starts with manual resets from script, so on balance it would be nice to avoid this bug potential and keep a local solution, at least for now. If we get any later similar issues we can re-evaluate this.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112810/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112810/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}